  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "May is at Lily's house today. She sees a big picture on the wall. \"Who is in the picture?\" asks May. \"It is my family,\" says Lily. \"This is my dad. He is my father. He likes the radio. He sings with it!\" Mom is the woman with long black hair. She is very beautiful. Mom is in the kitchen now.",
      "\"Look at the man with the fish,\" says Lily. \"He is my grandpa. He likes fishing.\" \"Who is the boy?\" asks May. \"He is Tom, my brother. He is nine.\" \"Is that a dog?\" asks May. \"Yes! That is Pip. Pip is in the family too.\"",
      "May smiles at the picture. \"I have a family too,\" she says. \"I have Mom, Dad, and Pat.\" \"Can I draw them?\" \"Yes, you can,\" says Lily. She gives May paper and a pen. May draws her family. Pip sits next to her. \"What a nice picture!\" says Lily."
    ],
